        },
        {
          "text": "Nuwe kwangasana kw'ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga, kandi kisisani kyonyini eky'obwaruhanga bwe, iguru n'ensi abihangiize n'ekigambo kye ky'obusobozi. Obu yamazire kukora eky'okwogyaho ebibi, yaikarra omwiguru ha mukono gw'obulyo ogwa Ruteerengwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
